---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="IDEMIA / Morpho | Providers | NoRec.US" description="Government identity credentials, driver-license/ID issuance, facial recognition, biometric identification, and identity-enrollment systems." active="surveillance">
<main class="page_shell provider_detail">
  <header class="article_header provider_header">
    <p class="eyebrow">PROVIDER / PLATFORM</p>
    <h1>IDEMIA / Morpho</h1>
    <p class="article_deck">Government identity credentials, driver-license/ID issuance, facial recognition, biometric identification, and identity-enrollment systems.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="provider_scope_notice">
    <span class="status_label">EVIDENCE SCOPE</span>
    <p><strong>Vendor capability</strong> describes the provider’s published product features. <strong>Illinois deployment</strong> is listed only when supported by Illinois records or a clearly labeled secondary source.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">ILLINOIS CONNECTION</p>
    <h2>Documented Illinois relationships</h2>
    <div class="provider_evidence_grid">
      <article><span class="status_label">DOCUMENTED</span><h3>Illinois Secretary of State</h3><p>Illinois procurement records describe an IDEMIA contract covering DL/ID software, printing and facial recognition.</p></article>
      <article><span class="status_label">DOCUMENTED</span><h3>Continuing credential relationship</h3><p>Later Illinois procurement/change-order material documents the continuing IDEMIA/Morpho relationship for Illinois credential production.</p></article>
      <article><span class="status_label">DOCUMENTED</span><h3>Statutory environment</h3><p>Illinois statutes separately regulate disclosure of credential photos and facial-recognition search services.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">PRODUCT / PLATFORM CAPABILITY</p>
    <h2>Published product capabilities</h2>
    <div class="provider_capability_grid">
      <article><h3>Physical driver licenses / IDs</h3><p>IDEMIA markets government-issued physical driver-license and identification credential systems.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Identity enrollment / issuance</h3><p>Its North American portfolio includes enrollment, camera, back-office, testing and issuance systems.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Facial recognition</h3><p>IDEMIA's current portfolio includes facial-recognition products and services.</p></article>
      <article><h3>Multi-biometric systems</h3><p>The company also markets multi-biometric identification/search systems and fingerprint products. These broader offerings are not automatically part of Illinois SoS deployment.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY / GOVERNANCE QUESTIONS</p>
    <h2>Privacy and governance</h2>
    <div class="provider_questions">
      <details><summary>Architecture still under investigation</summary><p>The Illinois procurement establishes IDEMIA's facial-recognition role but does not establish every production component, template architecture, retention rule, or search workflow.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Vendor capability ≠ state configuration</summary><p>IDEMIA sells a broad biometric portfolio. Illinois-specific features are attributed only when supported by Illinois records.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Credential population</summary><p>Because Illinois credentials include minors as well as adults, system-scope questions should distinguish captured photographs from separately stored biometric templates.</p></details>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="official_product_links">
    <p class="eyebrow">OFFICIAL PRODUCT INFORMATION</p>
    <h2>Vendor documentation</h2>
    <p>Vendor pages describe current products and features. Illinois deployment claims remain tied to Illinois-specific evidence.</p>
    <ul class="provider_source_list">
      <li><a href="https://na.idemia.com/our-technology/" rel="external">IDEMIA North America technology portfolio</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://na.idemia.com/ci/driver-enrollment-and-issuance/" rel="external">Driver enrollment and issuance</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE REFERENCES</p>
    <h2>Illinois records and supporting sources</h2>
    <ul class="provider_source_list">
      <li><a href="https://www.bidbuy.illinois.gov/bso/external/bidDetail.sda?docId=23-350SOS-SOS35-B-32203&external=true&parentUrl=close">Illinois BidBuy — DL/ID software, printing and facial recognition</a></li>
      <li><a href="/surveillance/face/illinois-id-photos/">Illinois credential-photo / facial-recognition case file</a></li>
      <li><a href="/sources/">Source library</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <div class="hero_actions">
    <a class="button button_dark" href="/surveillance/">Back to Surveillance</a>
    <a class="button button_light" href="/sources/">Source Library</a>
  </div>
</main>
</BaseLayout>
